  "measure": "Angular phase densities per outgoing solid angle, before material Fresnel/sheen and actual incident RGB. These are not image luminance or a measured BSDF.",
  "diagnosis": [
    "Full bundleScatter retains specularIntensity through material.specularColor and F_Schlick; it does not discard that control.",
