    "R12 redistributes that reflection azimuth using a normalized cos^8(phi/2) density mixed by live finishFocus * anisotropy * (1-lusterWidth)^2.",
    "Footprint Gaussian convolution damps harmonics without changing their constant term. Longitudinal filtering, transmission, opacity, lights and shadow handling are unchanged."
  ],
