    "No silhouette, radius or spacing change. Uniform rod geometry can remain visible despite finish redistribution.",
    "Diffuse and environment contributions stay unchanged. A broad environment may dilute the direct highlight distinction.",
    "No new self-transmission solution; the existing opaque shadow attenuation remains.",
    "Shader source and CPU tests do not establish GPU compile or visible improvement; main thread must inspect matched studio/raking/backlit renders."
